flowchart LR
  A[Stable Identity] --> B[Dependency]
  B --> C[Orthogonal State]
  C --> D[Authority / Policy Gate]
  D --> E[Action / Projection]
  E --> F[Evidence / Return]
  F --> G[Reconciliation]
  G --> H[Re-entry / Rebuild]
  H --> I[Growth / Failure Memory]
  I --> A

  L[Legacy / Historical Artifact] -. explicit provenance or rebuild purpose only .-> F
  L -. blocked by default .-> C

  X[Carrier: GitHub / Drive / Local / DB / CDE] --> E
  X -. no authority by itself .-> D

  U[User Learning] --> UC[Core Learning Candidate]
  UC --> D
  D --> CA[Core Admission]

  R[Return Received] --> F
  R -. not equal .-> G
